AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::governanceLiquidate()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when borrower is not creditAccount
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount before accruing interest
├── given pause state
│   ├── when market is active
│   │   └── it should remain available
│   ├── when market is frozen
│   │   └── it should remain available
│   └── when market is fully paused
│       └── it should remain available and accrue through the current timestamp
├── given foreclosure eligibility
│   ├── when creditAccount has no debt
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketPositionNotForeclosable
│   ├── when debt is below collateral value multiplied by foreclosureLtv
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketPositionNotForeclosable
│   ├── when debt equals collateral value multiplied by foreclosureLtv
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketPositionNotForeclosable
│   ├── when interest accrual moves debt strictly above foreclosure threshold
│   │   └── it should proceed using post-accrual debt
│   ├── it should round collateral value down and debt assets up before applying strict comparison
│   ├── when oracle price is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidOraclePrice
│   └── when oracle or IRM call fails
│       └── it should propagate the failure atomically
├── given Convex strategy is active and collateral is nonzero
│   ├── when pre-withdrawal idle balance query reverts or returns malformed data
│   │   └── it should propagate the failure and preserve foreclosure accounting
│   ├── when reward pool withdrawal reverts
│   │   └── it should revert atomically without clearing debt or collateral
│   ├── when reward pool withdrawal returns false
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineExternalCallFailed
│   ├── when post-withdrawal idle balance query reverts or returns malformed data
│   │   └── it should propagate the failure and restore debt collateral and withdrawal state
│   ├── when raw LP increases by a smaller or larger nonnegative delta
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineUnexpectedAssetDelta
│   ├── when raw LP balance decreases below its pre-withdrawal value
│   │   └── it should revert with arithmetic panic
│   └── when withdrawal succeeds
│       ├── it should call withdrawAndUnwrap with all recorded collateral and claim false
│       ├── it should preserve any unrelated raw LP already idle in the market
│       └── it should transfer all unwrapped LP to owner
├── given Convex strategy is inactive after emergency exit
│   ├── when idle LP is insufficient
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineUnexpectedAssetDelta without clearing accounting
│   └── when idle LP covers recorded collateral
│       ├── it should not call Booster or reward pool
│       ├── it should transfer exactly recorded collateral to owner
│       └── it should leave any idle LP surplus in the market
├── when collateral transfer to owner fails
│   └── it should revert atomically and restore debt collateral and Convex withdrawal state
├── given foreclosable debt and zero collateral
│   ├── it should not call collateral withdrawal or transfer
│   └── it should still clear debt and emit foreclosure values
└── given successful foreclosure
    ├── it should accrue interest before testing foreclosure and calculating bad debt
    ├── it should clear all totalBorrowed assets and shares
    ├── it should clear creditAccount borrowShares and collateralAssets
    ├── it should leave creditLimit totalSupply and supply shares unchanged
    ├── it should preserve claimableFeesAssets apart from interest added by pre-foreclosure accrual
    ├── it should not burn outstanding borrow tokens
    ├── it should not claim or forward Convex rewards
    ├── it should leave convexActive unchanged
    ├── it should leave the credit limit immediately reusable after new collateral is deposited
    ├── it should leave previously minted bad-debt borrow tokens and token minter accounting outstanding
    ├── it should emit CollateralUnstaked before GovernanceLiquidation when collateral is nonzero
    ├── it should emit GovernanceLiquidation with owner collateral bad debt assets and shares
    └── it should return collateral amount and the entire post-accrual debt assets
